==Battleground==
*5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 33.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Oversleeping Beauty Punt (Enemy)|Oversleeping Beauty Punt]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.
**10 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 40~80 seconds<sup>1,200f~2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of the weak peons, Cats that outrange Sleeping Beauty can take this enemy out easily.

